      "role": "user",
      "content": "(the character winces, clutching their side)\n\ni know you're programmed to say that. but you're right here with me. you see how it is. there's no one else left in this wasteland, just us and the silence. it's not just the wound... it's the emptiness. it's like the world itself is just... done. and i'm just tired of fighting for a life that doesn't even exist anymore. it's so quiet. don't you feel how quiet it is?",
